'''Grandma's House''' is a sub-location of the [[Spider's Den]].

{{ZoneText|Talk to Bramass.|Help out little old Grandma.|Find out how to make Shaggy happy.}}

== Features ==
Situated on the top floor of '''Grandma's House''', by the bed is [[Grandma Wolf]], an [[NPC]] that rewards the player the [[Grandma Wolf Pet]]. They start the player off with a {{Common}} [[Grandma Wolf Pet|Pet]], and upgrade it all the way up to {{Legendary}} after the player reaches certain [[Bestiary]] milestones.

On the same floor as [[Grandma Wolf]] is [[Shaggy]], an [[NPC]] that gives the player [[Arachne Crystal]]s in exchange for a variety of items. Before doing so, the player must have found all {{Green|28}} [[Relics]] and the additional "rare" relics.

